when he moved up there, he set up his own relationship with the museum. museum in Vancouver. He told us that he's been testing thousands of kids a year. Wow. So it's become a real, I don't like to say it's a gold mine, because that really emphasizes just the data collection aspect. But it's been a very beneficial and productive relationship for both sides, I think. Well, great, Dr. Blake. This has been very fascinating. Thanks so much for joining us. Thank you.

